            "//PHASE-B1-DISABLED-USING-BARE-CREATE-FOR-LOAD-INSTEAD: unknown ceSecondGalaxyStatus = ImportedFunction('CESecondMapAdapter','CEAdapterSecondGalaxyStatus');",
